{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22027","main_id":22027,"main_title":"神明啊，回应我吧！","main_description":"名为翔太的孩子，似乎正为某些事情感到苦恼…","chapter_title":"神明啊，回应我吧！","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":2202702,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202702,"sequence":3,"variant":0,"line_id":220270204,"next_line_ids":[220270205],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3001,"speaker_text_hash":1515577341,"speaker":"弥生七月","speaker_raw":"弥生七月","text_hash":2776621586,"text":"…想要向神龛供奉漆器，所以想要自己来做一个？","raw_text":"…想要向神龛供奉漆器，所以想要自己来做一个？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202702.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22027","main_id":22027,"main_title":"神明啊，回应我吧！","main_description":"名为翔太的孩子，似乎正为某些事情感到苦恼…","chapter_title":"神明啊，回应我吧！","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":2202702,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202702,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":220270205,"next_line_ids":[220270206],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3045,"speaker_text_hash":392349677,"speaker":"翔太","speaker_raw":"翔太","text_hash":1955565330,"text":"拜托了，七月姐姐，我有很想实现的愿望！而且我…我一定不会把你的秘方告诉别人的！","raw_text":"拜托了，七月姐姐，我有很想实现的愿望！而且我…我一定不会把你的秘方告诉别人的！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202702.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22027","main_id":22027,"main_title":"神明啊，回应我吧！","main_description":"名为翔太的孩子，似乎正为某些事情感到苦恼…","chapter_title":"神明啊，回应我吧！","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":2202702,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202702,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":220270206,"next_line_ids":[220270207],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3001,"speaker_text_hash":1515577341,"speaker":"弥生七月","speaker_raw":"弥生七月","text_hash":3222448082,"text":"这不是涂料配方的问题。要制作出精美的漆器，除了涂料之外，还需要长年累月的练习。","raw_text":"这不是涂料配方的问题。要制作出精美的漆器，除了涂料之外，还需要长年累月的练习。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202702.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22027","main_id":22027,"main_title":"神明啊，回应我吧！","main_description":"名为翔太的孩子，似乎正为某些事情感到苦恼…","chapter_title":"神明啊，回应我吧！","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":2202702,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202702,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":220270207,"next_line_ids":[220270208],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3001,"speaker_text_hash":1515577341,"speaker":"弥生七月","speaker_raw":"弥生七月","text_hash":1470172818,"text":"这不仅是时间问题，更是…财力问题。我家的漆器手艺传到我这里，已经是第四代了。","raw_text":"这不仅是时间问题，更是…财力问题。我家的漆器手艺传到我这里，已经是第四代了。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202702.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22027","main_id":22027,"main_title":"神明啊，回应我吧！","main_description":"名为翔太的孩子，似乎正为某些事情感到苦恼…","chapter_title":"神明啊，回应我吧！","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":2202702,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202702,"sequence":7,"variant":0,"line_id":220270208,"next_line_ids":[220270209],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3001,"speaker_text_hash":1515577341,"speaker":"弥生七月","speaker_raw":"弥生七月","text_hash":66481114,"text":"为了研究漆器，我甚至还去须弥游学过。所以，你想要一下子学会制作漆器…实在是不太可能。","raw_text":"为了研究漆器，我甚至还去须弥游学过。所以，你想要一下子学会制作漆器…实在是不太可能。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202702.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22027","main_id":22027,"main_title":"神明啊，回应我吧！","main_description":"名为翔太的孩子，似乎正为某些事情感到苦恼…","chapter_title":"神明啊，回应我吧！","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":2202702,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202702,"sequence":8,"variant":0,"line_id":220270209,"next_line_ids":[220270210],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3045,"speaker_text_hash":392349677,"speaker":"翔太","speaker_raw":"翔太","text_hash":2888213122,"text":"是…是这样吗？可是，我也想不到去给神龛供奉什么好东西了…","raw_text":"是…是这样吗？可是，我也想不到去给神龛供奉什么好东西了…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202702.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22027","main_id":22027,"main_title":"神明啊，回应我吧！","main_description":"名为翔太的孩子，似乎正为某些事情感到苦恼…","chapter_title":"神明啊，回应我吧！","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":2202702,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202702,"sequence":9,"variant":0,"line_id":220270210,"next_line_ids":[220270211],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3001,"speaker_text_hash":1515577341,"speaker":"弥生七月","speaker_raw":"弥生七月","text_hash":1940446730,"text":"我觉得，向神龛供奉物品这种事，最重要的并不是物品的价值，而是这个物品所代表的「心意」才对。","raw_text":"我觉得，向神龛供奉物品这种事，最重要的并不是物品的价值，而是这个物品所代表的「心意」才对。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202702.json"}
